e><figure><img alt=\"目前《你媽》在2025年12月26日推出後，已於Steam累積了「極度好評」的評價，許多玩家都正在開心的玩《你媽》當中。（《你媽》Steam評論區）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260112/1087378472726695936319457.jpeg/QVndzijnXyDa_UI6iyYmBLwDCQXw4CAd93u2qPd7tqg\"/><figcaption>目前《你媽》在2025年12月26日推出後，已於Steam累積了「極度好評」的評價，許多玩家都正在開心的玩《你媽》當中。（《你媽》Steam評論區）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲「Goody25」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T04:15:19.477820+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1826,"images":19,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T04:00:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T06:50:34.344801+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T04:08:46.325403+00:00","content_hash":"09d3b1027ecf93f6f91bb8e255b74c5a00d272a7844854abd86ea2b428e567c8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}